# C468: the headless boot test runs the real bot, which writes its three logs
# into the code directory. They are test residue, not source.
# C478: ANCHORED WITH A LEADING SLASH. Unanchored, these patterns match at ANY
# depth, so they also hid logs/*.log on the logs branch -- the hourly push
# copied 26 files, git ignored 24 of them, and the commit said "26 file(s)"
# while the tree held two. A leading slash means "the repo root only".
/omega_report_*.log
/omega_session_*.log
/omega_detail_*.log
